            "review_title": "Review at Little Hanoi Restaurants",
            "review_text": "Thomas L\nSingapore179 contributions\n0\nGreat food at affordable price, always a favorite\nMar 2026 • Family\nEvery time I have come to Hanoi, I have had meals at Little Hanoi, be it at its old or its new location. Atmosphere is the same, old colonial charm, friendly service, and quality food that remains value-for-money. The 5-spices chicken and the mini spring rolls are our all-time favorites. Waiting time (both to enter and for the food to arrive) is quite reasonable, which means the kitchen staff is rather efficient. The fact it has been operating for almost 30 years is a testimony to its quality. We recommend the experience & food to anyone who wants to eat well, in a peaceful environment, without breaking the bank! Please keep it on!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 4, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
