            "review_text": "Gavin J\n4 contributions\n0\nSo good we went twice!\nNov 2025 • Family\nWe stumbled upon Little Hanoi because it was right next to our hotel, and it ended up being one of the best dining decisions of our trip. We enjoyed our first dinner there so much that we happily returned two nights later. \n\nThe staff were incredibly friendly and welcoming, creating a warm and relaxed atmosphere. The prices were excellent and the food was outstanding both times.\n\nIf you’re staying nearby Little Hanoi is absolutely worth a visit. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten November 25, 2025",
